/* Red-path meta-scenario 1 of 2: a run that records a FAILED CHECK.

   This scenario is supposed to fail.  It is the proof that the whole verdict
   chain works - script check -> AutomationChecks verdict -> AutomationRunner
   -> GuiMain exit code -> the engine's assertion - because without it every
   green result in this suite would be unfalsifiable: a chain that could never
   report failure would report success just as reliably if it were broken.

   The green check comes first, so the run also proves that ONE red check
   sinks the run without suppressing what was recorded around it. */
checkTrue("this-one-is-green", true);
failCheck("deliberate", "this run must fail");
